// A `fall` CARRIES ITS ROAD, AND NOTHING MORE (DEF-437 with DEF-536, landing 177d2b): the controls of
// `tests/analysis/rejection/fall_carries_its_road.npk`, one module per cell, every `f` returning 7. A labelled arm nothing falls
// into keeps its refinement and its guard's grant (`p1`, `p2`); a `fall` that carries the grant keeps it (`q437_fall_carries_grant_ok`,
// `mf3c`, `f1c`, `lp1c`, `df1c`); an arm with no label takes no road (`q437_later_plain_arm_ok`); the same arms without the `fall`
// are untouched (`e_*_c`, `y4d`); an inner pick's road is the inner pick's, before, after and beside the outer's (`np1c`, `np4c`,
// `np5c`); a macro's `fall` with nothing moved (`ls3c`); and a move in code after the `fall` isn't on its road (`dc2c`).
